The "destroy armor" spell can affect dragonscale mail and polished
silver shields, though you'd have to be sloppy or unlucky to actually
have your stuff destroyed this way.  It's more useful against fireproof
cloaks of magic resistance, since it removes the fireproofing _every_
time... thus making your stuff vulnerable to fire traps again.

> I really like this idea of making speed boots have a less guaranteed 
