Well... depends on what you consider 'useful'.  The Slow duration isn't
all _that_ long, from the player's perspective, since he only gets a few
turns.  But it can be deceptive, since the critters around you move as
normal.  Depending on how bad the situation is, a speed potion might or
might not be useful since going to your bag is going to be ... well, a
'slow' process :)

